{"ch": 100, "verses": [{"n": 1, "ar": "بِسۡمِ اللّٰہِ الرَّحۡمٰنِ الرَّحِیۡمِ ﴿۱﴾", "en": "In the name of Allah, the Gracious, the Merciful.", "w": ["in the name of", "Allah", "the Gracious", "the Merciful", ""]}, {"n": 2, "ar": "وَالۡعٰدِیٰتِ ضَبۡحًا ۙ﴿۲﴾", "en": "By the snorting chargers <i>of the warriors</i>,", "w": ["by the chargers <i>of the warriors</i>", "snorting", ""]}, {"n": 3, "ar": "فَالۡمُوۡرِیٰتِ قَدۡحًا ۙ﴿۳﴾", "en": "Striking sparks of fire,", "w": ["and the producers of sparks", "striking", ""]}, {"n": 4, "ar": "فَالۡمُغِیۡرٰتِ صُبۡحًا ۙ﴿۴﴾", "en": "And making raids at dawn,", "w": ["and making raids", "at dawn", ""]}, {"n": 5, "ar": "فَاَثَرۡنَ بِہٖ نَقۡعًا ۙ﴿۵﴾", "en": "And raising clouds of dust thereby,", "w": ["and raising", "thereby", "clouds of dust", ""]}, {"n": 6, "ar": "فَوَسَطۡنَ بِہٖ جَمۡعًا ۙ﴿۶﴾", "en": "[✲]And penetrating thereby into the centre of <i>the enemy</i> forces,", "w": ["and penetrating  into the centre", "thereby", "of <i>the enemy</i> forces", ""]}, {"n": 7, "ar": "اِنَّ الۡاِنۡسَانَ لِرَبِّہٖ لَکَنُوۡدٌ ۚ﴿۷﴾", "en": "Surely, man is ungrateful to his Lord;", "w": ["surely", "man", "to his Lord", "is ungrateful", ""]}, {"n": 8, "ar": "وَاِنَّہٗ عَلٰی ذٰلِکَ لَشَہِیۡدٌ ۚ﴿۸﴾", "en": "And surely, he is a witness unto that;", "w": ["and surely, he", "unto", "that", "is a witness", ""]}, {"n": 9, "ar": "وَاِنَّہٗ لِحُبِّ الۡخَیۡرِ لَشَدِیۡدٌ ؕ﴿۹﴾", "en": "And surely, he is very keen for the love of wealth.", "w": ["and surely, he", "for the love", "of wealth", "is very keen", ""]}, {"n": 10, "ar": "اَفَلَا یَعۡلَمُ اِذَا بُعۡثِرَ مَا فِی الۡقُبُوۡرِ ۙ﴿۱۰﴾", "en": "Does not such a one know that when those in the graves are raised,", "w": ["does not", "such a one know", "when", "those are raised", "that", "in", "the graves", ""]}, {"n": 11, "ar": "وَحُصِّلَ مَا فِی الصُّدُوۡرِ ﴿ۙ۱۱﴾", "en": "And that which is in the breasts is brought forth,", "w": ["and is brought forth", "that which is", "in", "the breasts", ""]}, {"n": 12, "ar": "اِنَّ رَبَّہُمۡ بِہِمۡ یَوۡمَئِذٍ لَّخَبِیۡرٌ ﴿٪۱۲﴾", "en": "Surely their Lord will, on that day, be fully Aware of them.", "w": ["surely", "their Lord will", "of them", "on that day", "be fully Aware", ""]}]}